{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1913","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Game with Multiset"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1.5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In this problem, you are initially given an empty multiset. You have to process two types of queries:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ADD"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$x$$$ — add an element equal to $$$2^{x}$$$ to the multiset; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"GET"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$w$$$ — say whether it is possible to take the sum of some subset of the current multiset and get a value equal to $$$w$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\le m \\le 10^5$$$) — the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$m$$$ lines follow, each of which contains two integers $$$t_i$$$, $$$v_i$$$, denoting the $$$i$$$-th query. If $$$t_i = 1$$$, then the $$$i$$$-th query is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ADD"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$v_i$$$ ($$$0 \\le v_i \\le 29$$$). If $$$t_i = 2$$$, then the $$$i$$$-th query is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"GET"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$v_i$$$ ($$$0 \\le v_i \\le 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"GET"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" query, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is possible to choose a subset with sum equal to $$$w$$$, or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is impossible."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n1 0\n1 0\n1 0\n2 3\n2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n1 0\n1 1\n1 2\n1 10\n2 4\n2 6\n2 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nYES\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1913C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1913/problem/C"}